PR Title: Fix nonsynth cache UC store hit bug

PR Description:
The PR fixes issue #1086. According to the description: "Root cause was implementation of the nonsynth cache used in the ME testbench. Uncached stores targeting valid cache blocks were not self-invalidating the block, causing the store to get lost if targeted by following cacheable load. Bug is only present in the ME testbench, not in a real BP system."

